### Notes / Follow-ups
- **Backend is the source of truth** for team identity/membership; `color`, `categories`, `channels`, `directMessages` and member `role`/`status` remain local view state (the backend `Team` model does not store them). Channels are already backed by chats via `$storex.chats.createNewChat`.
